Package: porelo-host
Version: [[porelo.package.version]]
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Michael Schnell <michael@fuin.org>
Homepage: https://github.com/porelo-ai/porelo
Depends: libc6 (>= [[package.glibc.floor]]), zlib1g
Description: The host's own privileged program
 Run by sudo rules and root's units for the person sudo names, never typed by
 a person. This package installs no sudo rule, unit or timer; those belong to
 the host collection.
